      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Steam turbine overhaul, gas turbine inspections, generator maintenance and rotating equipment repair for plants across Warri, Ekpan, Sapele and the Ughelli axis. Engineers and tooling mobilise from Lagos, with spares kitted before your outage window opens.</p>
