<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Warri sits at the centre of Delta State's refining, petrochemical and gas gathering corridor, and most of the rotating equipment holding that corridor together has been in service for decades. Steam turbines, industrial gas turbines, boiler feed pumps, process compressors and captive generator sets in this belt were commissioned long before the current maintenance teams arrived, and formal OEM support for several of those frames has thinned or ended. The result is familiar to anyone running a plant here: unplanned trips, outages that stretch while a single obsolete part is chased, and machines nursed along on vibration readings nobody is comfortable with.</p><p>Axiom Power Services works across Warri and the wider Delta industrial belt, including Effurun, Uvwie, Ekpan, Ubeji, Udu, Aladja, Sapele and the Ughelli axis, and out to riverine sites reached by boat from Warri. We scope turbine and generator work before we price it, using borescope, vibration and lube oil data to establish what the machine actually needs, then issue a written work pack with a spares list that flags long lead items early. To start, <a href="/power-plant-audit-nigeria/">book a plant assessment</a> or call +234 803 000 0000 to request a technical proposal.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Warri</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Warri Plants</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Steam Turbine Overhaul and Outage Support</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Casing lift, rotor removal, diaphragm and blading inspection, bearing, gland and governor work on steam sets around Warri, Ekpan and Sapele. On units of this vintage the recurring findings are wet steam erosion at the last LP stages, wiped thrust pads and gland leakage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Gas Turbine Inspections and Hot Section Work</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Borescope, combustion and hot gas path inspections on industrial gas turbines across Delta State, scheduled on equivalent operating hours and starts rather than on the calendar. Salt aerosol off the Escravos coast and year round humidity foul axial compressors faster here than at inland sites.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Industrial Generator and Genset Maintenance</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Stator and rotor testing, insulation resistance and polarisation index, excitation and AVR work, bearing and cooling checks for the captive and standby sets that carry Warri plants through grid excursions. Sets are proved on load bank at rated load, not signed off at idle.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Rotating Equipment Repair and Obsolete Spares</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Process pumps, centrifugal and reciprocating compressors, gearboxes, fans and blowers repaired, laser aligned and balanced on site or in workshop. Where the part number is withdrawn, we dimension the component and produce a manufacturable drawing instead of waiting on a discontinued catalogue.</p>
      </div>
</div>
